  "description": "Sunday Soul is a retro, groovy bubble font inspired by the carefree charm of the 70s.Its bold curves and smooth, rounded edges create a fun, playful, and soulful look that brightens any design.Perfect for vintage posters, funky t-shirts, stickers, quotes, logos, and creative branding, this font adds a warm, nostalgic touch wherever it’s used.Bring your words to life with Sunday Soul — bold, bubbly, and full of retro personality.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Sunday Soul is a retro, groovy bubble font inspired by the carefree charm of the 70s.<br>Its bold curves and smooth, rounded edges create a fun, playful, and soulful look that brightens any design.<br>Perfect for vintage posters, funky t-shirts, stickers, quotes, logos, and creative branding, this font adds a warm, nostalgic touch wherever it’s used.<br>Bring your words to life with Sunday Soul — bold, bubbly, and full of retro personality.</p>",
